{
    "title": "Hexapolis: Civilization wars",
    "description": "Do you like civ turn-based strategy games? Hexapolis is a unique 4X game. Build a civilization,  win civilization wars against outlanders, and grow your HEX empire. Expand from a small village to a powerful catan Hex city.\r\n\r\nThis 4x civ game is about controlling the hex map, exploring unknown catan lands, fighting outlanders, and discovering settlers technologies. Are you ready to test your tactical strategy skills,  rise humankind and conquer the Hex battlefield??\r\n\r\nEach turn is full of adventure. You move on the hex map and explore new hexes with your warriors. Every hero has special abilities that help you conquer rival strongholds. There are stylized heroes: archers, sailors, dragons, crusaders, and many more! Technology progress is an important part of your strategy. You can choose your focus - are you a better farmer or warrior? Anyone can be a Hex hero. Farms, mines, and markets bring more coins to your production. The more coins you have, the more actions you can do in each turn.\r\n\r\nHexapolis features:\r\n\r\n\u25b6 Turn-based strategy game and kingdom maker\r\n\u25b6 Humankind, catan, and dorfromatik like\r\n\u25b6 4X - explore, expand, exploit, and exterminate\r\n\u25b6 Master technologies, explore hex map, wage war, and build a civilization of humankind\r\n\u25b6 Train your warriors and win battles against outlanders\r\n\u25b6 Two game modes - normal and hard\r\n\u25b6 Stylized in amazing low poly graphic\r\n\u25b6 Civilization game & building civilization\r\n\u25b6 Colonize the world of politopia\r\n\u25b6 Middle age war atmosphere\r\n\r\nHexapolis is a strategy game full of fighting, conquering, and technology development. Expand from a small village to a powerful catan city! \r\n\r\nExplore the medieval fantasy world with many challenges ahead. Make your hex civ stronger. It's your turn to build your epic civilization in our civilization game! The rise of humanity begins! Play now!\r\n\r\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/D8vhw8Rv\r\n\r\nFollow us to stay up to date with the latest updates:\r\n\r\nWEB http://noxgames.com/\r\nLinkedIn https://www.linkedin.com/company/noxgames-s-r-o\r\nFacebook https://www.facebook.com/noxgames/\r\nInstagram https://www.instagram.com/nox_games/\r\nTikTok https://www.tiktok.com/@noxgames_studio\r\n\r\nCreated by Noxgames 2024",
    "descriptionHTML": "Do you like civ turn-based strategy games? Hexapolis is a unique 4X game. Build a civilization,  win civilization wars against outlanders, and grow your HEX empire. Expand from a small village to a powerful catan Hex city.<br><br>This 4x civ game is about controlling the hex map, exploring unknown catan lands, fighting outlanders, and discovering settlers technologies. Are you ready to test your tactical strategy skills,  rise humankind and conquer the Hex battlefield??<br><br>Each turn is full of adventure. You move on the hex map and explore new hexes with your warriors. Every hero has special abilities that help you conquer rival strongholds. There are stylized heroes: archers, sailors, dragons, crusaders, and many more! Technology progress is an important part of your strategy. You can choose your focus - are you a better farmer or warrior? Anyone can be a Hex hero. Farms, mines, and markets bring more coins to your production. The more coins you have, the more actions you can do in each turn.<br><br>Hexapolis features:<br><br>\u25b6 Turn-based strategy game and kingdom maker<br>\u25b6 Humankind, catan, and dorfromatik like<br>\u25b6 4X - explore, expand, exploit, and exterminate<br>\u25b6 Master technologies, explore hex map, wage war, and build a civilization of humankind<br>\u25b6 Train your warriors and win battles against outlanders<br>\u25b6 Two game modes - normal and hard<br>\u25b6 Stylized in amazing low poly graphic<br>\u25b6 Civilization game &amp; building civilization<br>\u25b6 Colonize the world of politopia<br>\u25b6 Middle age war atmosphere<br><br>Hexapolis is a strategy game full of fighting, conquering, and technology development. Expand from a small village to a powerful catan city! <br><br>Explore the medieval fantasy world with many challenges ahead. Make your hex civ stronger. It&#39;s your turn to build your epic civilization in our civilization game! The rise of humanity begins! Play now!<br><br>Discord: https://d